  "non_circularity": "The conditional reduction is an exact algebraic identity, not a fit. The two Markov-chain solvers are validated against published anchors that were NOT used to build them: Montgomery Table 9.4 two-sided CUSUM, Siegmund's 1985 closed form, the exact geometric Shewhart law (via the lambda -> 1 EWMA limit at s != 1), and independent pinned-seed direct run-length simulation of the actual chart recursions.",
